    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1486">

                <pb facs="1247" n="1143" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1143"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/105.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-08-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 2, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Gratified that you are actively interesting yourself for Leguía’s safety. It
                    would be a grave misfortune should political differences result in violence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
